# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# 发布构建产物（见 一键构建.cmd / tools/build-release.ps1）
dist/
build-release.log

# 编辑器里按「Build」打出来的游戏（见 crates/xgame-editor/src/builder.rs）
projects/*/Build/

# Rust 插件的编译产物（P0.5）：编辑器把 target/ 里的 DLL 同步到项目内的
# `Plugins/` 作为规范目录，玩家与打包器都只认这里。它是构建产物、随编随变 ——
# 不入库（否则每次按 Play 都是一次无意义的二进制 diff）。
projects/*/Plugins/

# 自动保存副本（xgame-editor 的崩溃恢复，见 Docs/决策记录.md §二十四）。
# 它是"这台机器上这一刻的现场"，跟着项目入库只会在别人机器上的 diff 里
# 冒出一堆与内容无关的整文件差异；而且一旦入库，下次别人打开项目就会被问
# "要不要恢复一台他不认识的机器上的现场"。
projects/*/.autosave/
/.workbuddy

# 本地测试、截图与发布验收产物；已跟踪的历史截图继续保留。
/outputs/
